{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "签名盖住什么",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 108.18,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "第一个边界，是用户的签名。",
   "spoken": "第一个边界，是用户的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户签的，是用户操作的哈希。",
   "spoken": "用户签的，是用户操作的哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.82,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 4.918,
   "speechEnd": 7.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "哈希怎么编码，决定了哪些字段受签名保护。",
   "spoken": "哈希怎么编码，决定了哪些字段受签名保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.376,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 8.474,
   "speechEnd": 11.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，Alchemy 披露过一个打包漏洞。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，Alchemy 批路过一个打包漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.012,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 13.11,
   "speechEnd": 16.395
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "EntryPoint 的打包函数，直接读取动态字段的偏移量，没有检查。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 的打包函数，直接读取动态字段的偏移亮，没有检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.456,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 17.554,
   "speechEnd": 22.363
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "结果，同一个用户操作，能算出不同的哈希。",
   "spoken": "结果，同一个用户操作，能算出不同的哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.436,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 23.534,
   "speechEnd": 27.26
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "不同的用户操作，也能算出同一个哈希。",
   "spoken": "不同的用户操作，也能算出同一个哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.312,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 28.41,
   "speechEnd": 31.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "示例 Paymaster 的签名，签完以后，内容仍能被改。",
   "spoken": "示例 Paymaster 的签名，签完以后，内容仍能被改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 32.276,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 32.374,
   "speechEnd": 36.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "EntryPoint 已经修复，没有已知损失。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 已经修复，没有已知损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.416,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 37.514,
   "speechEnd": 40.037
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第二个边界，是 Paymaster 自己的签名。",
   "spoken": "第二个边界，是 Paymaster 自己的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 41.092,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 41.19,
   "speechEnd": 44.082
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "这是另一套签名，也要覆盖链 ID、nonce 和有效期。",
   "spoken": "这是另一套签名，也要覆盖链 ID、nonce 和有效期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 45.128,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 45.226,
   "speechEnd": 49.333
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "少了任何一项，就可能被重放或抢跑。",
   "spoken": "少了任何一项，就可能被虫放或抢跑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 50.388,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 50.486,
   "speechEnd": 53.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "第三个边界，是账户自己的验证逻辑。",
   "spoken": "第三个边界，是账户自己的验证逻辑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 54.448,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 54.546,
   "speechEnd": 57.331
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "验证只检查签名。",
   "spoken": "验证只检查签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 58.388,
   "dur": 2.472,
   "speechStart": 58.486,
   "speechEnd": 60.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "验证写错了，执行的就是攻击者的调用。",
   "spoken": "验证写错了，执行的就是攻击者的掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 61.08,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 61.178,
   "speechEnd": 64.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2024 年 3 月，Code4rena 审计了 Coinbase Smart Wallet。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 3 月，Code4rena 审计了 Coinbase Smart Wallet。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 65.308,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 65.406,
   "speechEnd": 70.013
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "删除 owner 的操作，可以跨链重放。",
   "spoken": "删除 owner 的操作，可以跨链虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 71.072,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 71.17,
   "speechEnd": 73.682
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "各条链上，同一个位置的 owner 可能不同。",
   "spoken": "各条链上，同一个位置的 owner 可能不同。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 74.724,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 74.822,
   "speechEnd": 77.631
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "重放过去，可能删错人，甚至把账户永久锁死。",
   "spoken": "虫放过去，可能删错人，甚至把账户永久锁死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 78.688,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 78.786,
   "speechEnd": 82.798
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "修复后，改成传入 owner 地址，再核对。",
   "spoken": "修复后，改成传入 owner 地址，再核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 83.852,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 83.95,
   "speechEnd": 87.057
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "Biconomy 的审计里，智能账户的实现合约可以被销毁。",
   "spoken": "Biconomy 的审计里，智能账户的实现合约可以被销毁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 88.104,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 88.202,
   "speechEnd": 91.952
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "它的会话密钥模块，只限制单笔额度，不限制累计。",
   "spoken": "它的会话密钥模块，只限制单笔额度，不限制垒计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 93.004,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 93.102,
   "speechEnd": 96.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "所以，哈希和签名要覆盖规范的编码和链 ID。",
   "spoken": "所以，哈希和签名要覆盖规范的编码和链 ID。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 98.048,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 98.146,
   "speechEnd": 102.3
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "多链账户的管理操作，要防重放。",
   "spoken": "多链账户的管理操作，要防虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 103.356,
